      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1050901022,
      "text": "Sabal rosei, the Llanos palmetto or Savannah palmetto, is a species of flowering plant in the palm family Arecaceae, native to the Pacific coast of Mexico, from Sinaloa to Jalisco. Hardy to USDA zone 8a, it tolerates both flooding and drought, although it is typically found in dry areas."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Sabal rosei",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sabal_rosei",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 171501805,
      "text": "Sabal rosei es una especie de palmera originaria de México."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Sabal rosei",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sabal_rosei",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 29242229,
      "text": "Sabal rosei, yang dikenal sebagai Llanos palmetto atau Savannah palmetto, adalah spesies tumbuhan berbunga dalam keluarga palem Arecaceae, yang berasal dari pesisir Pasifik Meksiko, mulai dari Sinaloa hingga Jalisco. Tahan hingga zona USDA 8a, tumbuhan ini toleran terhadap banjir maupun kekeringan, meskipun biasanya ditemukan di daerah kering."
    }
